<title>UK: CAPITA BUYING DATAPAY FOR 9.3 MLN STG.</title>
<headline>CAPITA BUYING DATAPAY FOR 9.3 MLN STG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British business outsourcing and support services firm Capita Group Plc said on Thursday that it was buying Datapay, a provider of payroll processing services from IBM UK Ltd, for 9.3 million stg.</p>
<p>It will finance the acquisition through the issue of 3.45 million new shares, which will be placed with institutional investors at 269p per share.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
